[gd_scene format=3]

; The Orrery, past the Mantle's high door (map offset (491, -155)): a pit where the great rings of the core's orrery turn
; around a dark centre. Arcs of metal (the rings' segments, grippable) step down the pit, with mooring rings between
; them; at its bottom a plug of cracked glass over a flooded seam, the way down to the Lode: bored (Drill) and sunk
; (Ballast). The arcs climb back to the door (needing nothing).

